    "description": "The data show the weighing of pups following the standard method of CCAMLR \n(Commission for the Conservation of Antarctic Marine Living Resources) C2,\nversion B.  50 males and 50 females are weight every fortnight in one of the\nCape beaches Copihue, with the propose of studying their growing during the\nseason. This information is given annually to CCAMLR.",
